{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_cae83b625e1e","title":"小众软件","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704576&idx=1&sn=553f985fb888faa1216d5ed6abb5f687&chksm=bc6de45b5710a8fc5e095a685b37243c9456b4a40ef64bb91b89cfe28ee8cdc861f9b38bce03&scene=126&sessionid=1795076161#rd","description":"推荐有灵魂的电脑软件、手机应用。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"小众软件","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM5oB1jblgiarD8aOiaYBeEPnOE9DyicmmBJXIdUHFNC0h8MA%2F0","updated":"2026-11-19T07:38:31.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MjM5NDMwMTI2MA%3D%3D:2651704576:1","title":"电信光猫插件：能提取手机号、扫描内网","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704576&idx=1&sn=553f985fb888faa1216d5ed6abb5f687&chksm=bc6de45b5710a8fc5e095a685b37243c9456b4a40ef64bb91b89cfe28ee8cdc861f9b38bce03&scene=126&sessionid=1795076161#rd","description":"V2EX 网友分析了上海、浙江两台电信光猫里预装的 m01-b01-inner 插件，发现两个版本默认都会从明文 HTTP 请求中提取 IMEI，并定期上报联网设备清单。提取手机号的模块只在上海样本中发现。\n\n插件代码还包含远程执行命令和扫描内网端口的功能，其中端口扫描默认关闭。\n\n楼主分析时，两台光猫都已桥接并移除了远程管理通道，插件未能连上服务器，因此正常联网时实际上传了哪些数据，仍待抓包验证。\n\n/t/1257838","content":"<p>V2EX 网友分析了上海、浙江两台电信光猫里预装的 m01-b01-inner 插件，发现两个版本默认都会从明文 HTTP 请求中提取 IMEI，并定期上报联网设备清单。提取手机号的模块只在上海样本中发现。<br /><br />插件代码还包含远程执行命令和扫描内网端口的功能，其中端口扫描默认关闭。<br /><br />楼主分析时，两台光猫都已桥接并移除了远程管理通道，插件未能连上服务器，因此正常联网时实际上传了哪些数据，仍待抓包验证。<br /><br />/t/1257838</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxf0L1h5icwWBK6LymbuicAxnA2qWbHg2JUHQTuu0psEETOF9JMRIMdP0ia8xGC8icdhaVibo0WSJrP7gicYQurbeek28YH41l967PKvw%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxc6aoMgQOOs4Q8xwnlvoRSWLyciayv48PibgicyZrPsaXOIWLDiaCXvw0bbeEcd4ocVsUgHcGml4ZZqiaaP5